1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:04,704
In this lesson, you'll turn your
courses into something people can buy.

2
00:00:04,704 --> 00:00:09,381
You'll create an offer, set a price, and
let Kyntlo enrol buyers automatically,

3
00:00:09,381 --> 00:00:10,861
without lifting a finger.

4
00:00:11,712 --> 00:00:13,029
Here's the key idea.

5
00:00:13,029 --> 00:00:15,466
Members never buy a product directly.

6
00:00:15,466 --> 00:00:17,639
They get access through an offer.

7
00:00:17,639 --> 00:00:21,195
An offer bundles one or more
products, sets the price,

8
00:00:21,195 --> 00:00:24,356
and grants access when
someone pays or signs up.

9
00:00:25,208 --> 00:00:27,236
Bloom's current offers are free.

10
00:00:27,236 --> 00:00:32,052
Invisalign patients get their course
at no cost, as part of their treatment.

11
00:00:32,052 --> 00:00:36,424
Free offers are great for adding
value to a service you already sell.

12
00:00:36,424 --> 00:00:38,642
Now let's create a paid membership.

13
00:00:39,493 --> 00:00:41,703
Click Create Offer and give it a name.

14
00:00:41,703 --> 00:00:46,471
We'll call it Bloom Smile Club, a monthly
membership for patients who want to keep

15
00:00:46,471 --> 00:00:47,867
their smile at its best.

16
00:00:48,717 --> 00:00:50,014
Choose what's included.

17
00:00:50,014 --> 00:00:54,130
We'll add the Smile Care at Home
course, plus our members-only community,

18
00:00:54,130 --> 00:00:56,272
which we'll set up in the next lesson.

19
00:00:57,128 --> 00:00:58,004
Now, pricing.

20
00:00:58,004 --> 00:01:03,128
An offer can be free, a one-time payment,
a payment plan, or a subscription.

21
00:01:03,128 --> 00:01:05,420
Choose Subscription and enter £15.

22
00:01:05,420 --> 00:01:08,724
Members are billed every
month until they cancel,

23
00:01:08,724 --> 00:01:12,364
through the Stripe account
you connected in module 12.

24
00:01:13,219 --> 00:01:15,568
On the right are the access settings.

25
00:01:15,568 --> 00:01:19,123
With automatic access on, the
moment a payment succeeds,

26
00:01:19,123 --> 00:01:22,234
the buyer is enrolled in
everything in the offer,

27
00:01:22,234 --> 00:01:24,774
and gets an email with their login link.

28
00:01:24,774 --> 00:01:28,329
No manual work for you, and
no waiting for the customer.

29
00:01:29,179 --> 00:01:30,423
Click Publish offer.

30
00:01:30,423 --> 00:01:32,226
It's live, and ready to sell.

31
00:01:32,226 --> 00:01:36,516
You can edit the offer later, and
existing members keep their access.

32
00:01:37,367 --> 00:01:39,313
Share it with the checkout link.

33
00:01:39,313 --> 00:01:43,936
Put it in an email, a text message, or
behind a Join button on your website.

34
00:01:43,936 --> 00:01:46,673
If you'd rather sell
through a Kyntlo funnel,

35
00:01:46,673 --> 00:01:49,836
attach this offer to the
product in your order form,

36
00:01:49,836 --> 00:01:52,087
and buyers are enrolled the same way.

37
00:01:52,937 --> 00:01:53,800
Let's test it.

38
00:01:53,800 --> 00:01:55,219
Click Preview checkout.

39
00:01:55,219 --> 00:01:59,905
This is what buyers see: what's included,
the price, and a secure card form.

40
00:01:59,905 --> 00:02:02,064
We'll make a test purchase as Emma.

41
00:02:04,271 --> 00:02:07,613
Payment done, and Emma is
enrolled automatically.

42
00:02:07,613 --> 00:02:10,204
Her login email is already on its way.

43
00:02:10,204 --> 00:02:13,409
If a subscription payment
fails or she cancels,

44
00:02:13,409 --> 00:02:16,410
her access can be removed
automatically too.

45
00:02:17,259 --> 00:02:21,502
On the Courses dashboard, Emma now
appears under Recent enrolments,

46
00:02:21,502 --> 00:02:23,149
with the offer she joined.

47
00:02:23,149 --> 00:02:25,935
You can also grant an
offer from a workflow,

48
00:02:25,935 --> 00:02:30,685
for example giving every new Invisalign
patient their course automatically.

49
00:02:31,534 --> 00:02:32,552
Here's a pro tip.

50
00:02:32,552 --> 00:02:37,042
Before you charge for a course, give
it away free to a few loyal customers.

51
00:02:37,042 --> 00:02:41,952
Their feedback will make it better, and
their results become the testimonials that

52
00:02:41,952 --> 00:02:43,209
sell your paid offer.

53
00:02:44,189 --> 00:02:45,413
You're ready to sell!

54
00:02:45,413 --> 00:02:50,190
In the next lesson, we'll build the
members-only community we just included in our

55
00:02:50,190 --> 00:02:50,539
offer.

56
00:02:50,539 --> 00:02:51,355
See you there.
